  "title": "106th Rescue Wing Year in Review 2024",
  "description": "The 106th Rescue Wing takes a look back on events, trainings, and accomplishments over the past year in light of the upcoming year at Francis S. Gabreski Air National Guard Base, Westhampton Beach, N.Y., January 10, 2025. During the year 2024, the 106th participated in over 70 events including training events, morale events, and exercises. (U.S. Air National Guard video by Captain Cheran Campbell, Technical Sgt. Daniel Farrell, Technical Sgt. Sean Madden, Technical Sgt. Kevin Donaldson, and Senior Airman Sarah McKernan)\r\n(Adobe Stock Audio Licensing Code: ASLC-390E9AD3-9D7395FEC7)",
